% n16: an inductive with a constructor whose domain is a VALUE, not a type.
% Twin of n09: the twin rejects a pi with a value domain when it stands alone,
% and rejects it here when inside an inductive constructor. The kernel was observed
% to accept n09 in k_infer (no domain check in k_infer_pi), so it accepts n16 too
% because k_check_inductive_ctor never calls k_infer on each pi domain.
1 sort 0
axiom A : 1
2 const A
axiom a : 2
3 const a
4 const Foo
5 pi 3 4
inductive Foo : 1 | ctor : 5
